Theme fonts (self-hosted, no CDN, no local() fallbacks):

- Inter v4.1 (Regular 400, SemiBold 600), SIL OFL 1.1
  https://github.com/rsms/inter/releases/tag/v4.1
- JetBrains Mono v2.304 (Regular 400, Bold 700), SIL OFL 1.1
  https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono/releases/tag/v2.304
- Ionicons icon font (ionicons.*), MIT

Declared in css/typography.css; consumed only via --dz-font-family /
--dz-font-mono tokens (see DESIGN.md Typography and scripts/check-typography.sh).
